      ro: [],
      en: ["Area: approximately 1,100 km²", "Highest point: Loma del Toro at 2,367 m", "Annual rainfall: 400–2,500 mm", "Endemic species: Ricord's iguana (Cyclura ricordii) – fewer than 5,000 individuals", "Bird species: over 300 recorded", "Part of Jaragua-Bahoruco-Enriquillo Biosphere Reserve (since 2002)"],
